{
  "name": "verify-empty-declaration-deferred",
  "description": "The page sends the theme of the host, then prepares one layout whose surface of a plugin is a view that has not declared its composition; the syncSurfaces call carries no surface, and the host answers it with no placement, so the placement of the page defers the view.",
  "replay": false,
  "reason": "setTheme and syncSurfaces apply the theme and the placement of a window, and the Go producer runs only log and workspace calls without a window.",
